  "footnotes": [
    {
      "marker": "*",
      "text": "*Days -15 through -9 are allotted for washout of cocaine after admission. Subjects’ urine will be tested daily to document when it becomes negative for cocaine.",
      "appears_complete": true,
      "attaches_to": []
    },
    {
      "marker": "**",
      "text": "** Blood chemistries, including liver function tests, will be performed at outpatient and inpatient screening, on days 6 and 13, at discharge (day 17) and at follow-up (day 31).",
      "appears_complete": true,
      "attaches_to": []
    },
    {
      "marker": "***",
      "text": "*** Pregnancy test at intake screening should be done within 72 hours before the first screening cocaine infusion.",
      "appears_complete": true,
      "attaches_to": []
    },
    {
      "marker": "****",
      "text": "**** Cognitive assessments will be performed on day -7 and on day 11.",
      "appears_complete": true,
      "attaches_to": []
    },
    {
      "marker": "Xa",
      "text": "X^a - POMS, BSCS will be performed at intake and then every other day.",
      "appears_complete": true,
      "attaches_to": []
    },
    {
      "marker": "Xb",
      "text": "X^b - atomoxetine will be administered at 20 mg q.d. on days 0 and 1, 40 mg q.d. on days 2 and 3, 80 mg q.d. on days 4-8 and 100 mg q.d. on days 9-13.",
      "appears_complete": true,
      "attaches_to": []
    },
    {
      "marker": "Xc",
      "text": "X^c - VAS will be performed on days -10, -9, and on all infusion days.",
      "appears_complete": true,
      "attaches_to": []
    },
    {
      "marker": "Xd",
      "text": "X^d - ARCI will be performed on days -10, -9, and on all non-infusion days.",
      "appears_complete": true,
      "attaches_to": []
    },
    {
      "marker": "Xe",
      "text": "X^e - BPRS will be administered on baseline, every day during treatment with atomoxetine and on the days of all cocaine infusions.",
      "appears_complete": true,
      "attaches_to": []
    },
    {
      "marker": "Xf",
      "text": "X^f - atomoxetine blood levels will be determined on days 6, 8, 11 and 13.",
      "appears_complete": true,
      "attaches_to": []
    },
    {
      "marker": "a",
      "text": "S = serum, P = plasma;",
